#{[17592186442283 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442281 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442282 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1069 "q-278400" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1071 "For the ellipse $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{18}+\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{16}=1,$ find the lengths of its major and minor axes.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the major axis is \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the minor axis is \n{{field-2}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "35dee2e4-b90f-575e-8987-9a600b4e60ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442283 #edb/ref 1074 "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have $h=2$ and $k=-1,$ so the center is located at $(2,-1).$\n\nIn the given equation, we also have ${a}^{2}=18$ and ${b}^{2}=16.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=18,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{18}=3\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=16,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{16}=4.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $a=3\\sqrt{2},$ and the semi-minor axis has length $b=4.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 3\\sqrt{2}=6\\sqrt{2},$ and the minor axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 4=8.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442284 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "479cce25-13e7-5cc9-8b50-cb0c7ebd0554" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442284 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186295011 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442285 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442286 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442285 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5e449fb1-4c6a-52d2-ba8a-4d3471a77fb8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442285 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186442283 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442286 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442284 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442286 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5f6429ed-2ed5-5a9e-8dc2-d2bd00c04dcd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442286 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186295010 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442287 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442288 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442287 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6ea8cfec-9867-5979-9717-6e4a67bd667e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442287 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186295006 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442288 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442285 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442288 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "f7f3c721-aa49-5677-9ac6-7f79cac99137" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442288 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186295007 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
